# Single authoritative Docker build-context allowlist. The commercial game,
# local state, repository metadata, and unrelated files never reach Docker.
**

# Application payload
!LICENSE
!src
!src/**
!assets
!assets/README.md
!assets/checksums.sha256
!assets/scenarios
!assets/scenarios/*.sl2
!assets/templates
!assets/templates/bosses
!assets/templates/bosses/*.png
!assets/templates/duringGame
!assets/templates/duringGame/*.png
!assets/templates/introScreen
!assets/templates/introScreen/*.png
!assets/templates/pauseReturnMenu
!assets/templates/pauseReturnMenu/*.png
!examples
!examples/**

# Files consumed explicitly by docker/Dockerfile
!docker
!docker/container_requirements.txt
!docker/entrypoint.sh
!docker/bin
!docker/bin/dsle-doctor
!docker/bin/dsle-health
!docker/bin/dsle-instances
!docker/bin/dsle-server
!docker/xorg
!docker/xorg/nvidia.conf.template

# Defense in depth if a future allowlist rule becomes broader.
**/__pycache__
**/__pycache__/**
**/*.pyc
**/*.pyo
**/DarkSoulsRemastered.exe
